          <li><a href="#introduction" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">1. Introduction to the Cosmetics Industry</a></li>
          <li><a href="#product-categories" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">2. Major Product Categories</a></li>
